Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: shell32: Scale fixed pixel sizes of the folder view, menus and dialogs to the DPI.
 The file size and location parts of the folder view status bar had fixed
 widths, which clip their text once the font is scaled. The New menu,
 Open With, drive properties, File Types and Folder Options loaded their
 icons at 16 or 32 pixels; use the system icon sizes. Scale the depth of
 the drive usage pie chart, the Recycle Bin properties column and the
 layout of the file operation confirmation dialog.
